{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "438a3c03-6b6c-8543-aeb4-de892fc4db3b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:42:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:39:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is Sean Sullivan. I'm calling about my recycling bin. The truck damaged it this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. Damaged how, Mr. Sullivan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:39:18-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lid's cracked clean off the hinge and one side is caved in. I watched it happen from the window. The arm picked it up and dropped it hard, and then it rolled into the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. And what's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "206 Mill Street. Up on the Hill, not far from the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "206 Mill. Okay, let me write this down. Recycling bin, lid broken, side caved in, damaged by the truck at pickup this morning. Is that the blue one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Blue, yes. The one the city gave out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Is it still usable, or is it done for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:40:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's done for. I put the paper in a cardboard box to hold it until next time, but that won't last if it rains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Typically we can get a replacement out to you. I'll put in the request for you right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:40:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'd also like a supervisor to call me back, if somebody could. I want it on record that the truck did it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:40:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can do that. I'll leave a message for the supervisor with what you told me. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:40:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0176. That's the landline. I'm home most of the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:40:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-six. Got it. Any time that's better for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:40:58-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons are fine. Mornings I'm sometimes out. Oh, and if I'm slow getting to the phone, I'm on the computer and the fan in it is spinning loud. It's been going like a little jet engine all morning. I may not hear the phone right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, okay. So let it ring a while. I'll put that in the note too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:41:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I'd appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:41:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, the replacement. I can't tell you the exact day it'll come. The supervisor can probably give you a better idea when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:41:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just need to know somebody has it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:41:44-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody has it. Let me read it back. Sean Sullivan, 206 Mill Street, blue recycling bin damaged by the truck on today's pickup, needs a replacement, and you want a supervisor to call you back this afternoon at 401-555-0176. Did I get it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. You got it all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Should I make a note about the box, so they know you're making do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can, sure. Just so they know I'm not putting it out bare."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Sullivan. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
